# clang-tidy for the test sources. Inherits every check from the root
# .clang-tidy (InheritParentConfig) and only turns off the one check that Qt
# Test's structure makes impossible to satisfy.
#
# Disabled, with reason:
#   readability-convert-member-functions-to-static  a Qt Test case IS a private
#       slot: moc requires non-static member functions, and QTEST_GUILESS_MAIN
#       invokes them through the meta-object. Most test functions never touch
#       `this`, so the check fires on nearly every one of them (62 hits,
#       measured 2026-07-29) and every "fix" would break the test runner.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-convert-member-functions-to-static
